steps.description:
Create packages/mull/src/triggers/types.ts. Define:

1) EntityAccumulatorState: { sessionId: string, entities: ExtractedEntity[], facts: ExtractedFact[], topicMatches: TopicMatch[], entityCount: number, lastDeterministicAt: string, lastLlmRunAt: string | null, createdAt: string }

2) TriggerConfig: { enabled: boolean, entityThreshold: number (default 3), timerIntervalMinutes: number (default 20), persistDir: string (default '.mull/accumulators'), decisionTriggersLlm: boolean (default true) }

3) TriggerEvent: { type: 'trajectory' | 'retrospective' | 'decision', source: 'forge' | 'planner', sessionId: string, eventType: string, payload: unknown, timestamp: string }

4) LlmTriggerReason: 'entity_threshold' | 'decision_event' | 'timer' | 'session_end' | 'retrospective'
